steps.instructions:
Now open **style.css**. Give `.card` a white background, some space inside and round corners:

```css
.card {
  background-color: #ffffff;
  padding: 24px;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
```

`padding` is the space between the card's edge and what's inside it.

Lists come with bullets and an indent. Remove both in a `.card ul` rule:

```css
.card ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding-left: 0;
}
```

Flexbox lines things up. Make `body` a flex container and center what's inside it:

```css
body {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}
```

solution.content:
body {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  background-color: #eeede8;
}

.card {
  background-color: #ffffff;
  padding: 24px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  width: 320px;
}

.card img {
  width: 96px;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.card ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding-left: 0;
}
